    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 17
      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A tall, faceless fey shape wrapped in folded black wings that hang like a cloak. Where a face should be there is only a smooth hollow of shadow. Long claws rest crossed in front of its body, and it holds a slip of fluttering darkness pinched between two fingers like a moth: a stolen shadow.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.F9q63x7NzRmmeBGq]{01. The Shadowless Lodge}.</strong> The Fey Queen's ankou. Drops from the rafters once the PCs find the shadow jar or three clues, opens with Shadow Doubles, and withdraws below 150 HP. If it escapes, it returns as the Speaker or the spared ankou in encounter 14.</p>"
    },
